	"GiftLove.2": "#Goodness, @, you're spoiling me.|Really? Thank you! How did you know this was my favorite?",
	"GiftLove.3": "#Wow... I don't know what to say, @.$l|This is a wonderful gift! Thank you so much.",
	"GiftLike.1": "#Thank you, @. That means a lot.|That's such a nice gift. Thank you!",
	"GiftLike.2": "#What a sweet gift! I'm flattered.|I really appreciate this. It was nice of you to think of me.",
	"GiftLike.3": "#You always know how to brighten up my day.$h|Oh! What a nice surprise. Thank you, @.",
	"GiftNeutral": "#Thanks. That's very kind of you.", //I think it's funniest if the neutral dialogue is completely the same no matter what
	"GiftDislike.1": "#Mmm... good effort, @.|Hmm... Are you sure this is healthy?",
	"GiftDislike.2": "#Oh, this is... I'll figure out something to do with this.|Thank you? I'm not sure what you expect me to do with this.",
	"GiftDislike.3": "#Oh... thank you. That's... nice?|I think you may have meant to give this to someone else.",
	"GiftHate.1": "#I'm pretty sure I told you I was allergic to this.$a|...I think I'm allergic to this.",
	"GiftHate.2": "#Yikes. Are you trying to tell me something?$s|That's not very kind of you, @.",
