	"Gift.TruffleOil.1": "For me? Thank you! This will be fantastic drizzled on some pasta.$h",
	"Gift.TruffleOil.2": "Oh, wow. Really? This almost feels too fancy for me.#$b#Not that I'm complaining!$h",
	"Gift.TruffleOil.3": "You have incredible timing, @. I was just thinking I needed this for a recipe I want to try.$h",
	"Gift.Wine.1": "This looks fantastic! What an incredible gift, @.$h#$b#I'll have to save it for a special occasion.",
	"Gift.Wine.2": "Thank you!$h#$b#You would think as a doctor I would advise against the consumption of alcohol...#$b#But there are certainly benefits to kicking back with a glass of wine, provided one is drinking responsibly.$h",
	"Gift.Wine.3": "An entire bottle? That's very generous of you.$h",
	"Gift.Coffee.1": "Oh! Thank you. I was just thinking I could use a pick-me-up.$h",
	"Gift.Coffee.2": "You're a life-saver, @.#$b#I was too busy this morning to brew my own, so I really appreciate it.",
