  	"married_Maru": "Congratulations on your marriage, @. I'm so happy for the two of you.$h#$e#Maru's assured me she'll continue to help out at the clinic, but I promise I won't monopolize her time.",
  	"married_Harvey_oneyear": "You know what I just realized, @? It's been almost a year since the wedding.#$b#It's incredible how quickly the time went by...$l",
